its instances since the import, newest first. Type class resolution\ndepends on the global instances only through the classes it consults, and records their changes\ninstead of the generation of the whole table (`RecordedDeps.instClassChanges`). Recorded changes are\nonly compared within the module that recorded them, i.e. against states with the same imported\ninstances, so equal changes mean equal instances of the class. Restoring an earlier state (e.g. at\nthe end of a section) restores the changes with it.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Instances.html#Lean.Meta.Instances.classChanges","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"Lean.Meta.Instances.classChanges","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Instances.lean#L90-L90"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Instances.html#Lean.Meta.Instances.erased\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Instances</span>.<span class=\"name\">erased</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Instances.html#Lean.Meta.Instances\">Instances</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashSet.html#Lean.PHashSet\">PHashSet</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Instances.html#Lean.Meta.Instances.erased","kind":"def","line":81,"name":"Lean.Meta.Instances.erased","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Instances.lean#L81-L81"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Instances.html#Lean.Meta.Instances.instanceNames\